    "stdout": "{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/oxc/issues/30164\",\"repository_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/oxc\",\"labels_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/oxc/issues/30164/labels{/name}\",\"comments_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/oxc/issues/30164/comments\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/oxc/issues/30164/events\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/oxc-project/oxc/issues/30164\",\"id\":6580388979,\"node_id\":\"I_kwDOI7qa7s8AAAABiDjEcw\",\"number\":30164,\"title\":\"oxlint 1.95.0 crashes with SIGILL (rorx / BMI2) on Linux x86-64 CPUs without BMI2/AVX2\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"viktortar98\",\"id\":72432479,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNDMyNDc5\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72432479?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/viktortar98\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/viktortar98\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/viktortar98/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/viktortar98/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/viktortar98/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/viktortar98/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/viktortar98/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/viktortar98/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/viktortar98/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/viktortar98/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/viktortar98/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"labels\":[{\"id\":5326051831,\"node_id\":\"LA_kwDOI7qa7s8AAAABPXUZ9w\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/oxc/labels/A-linter\",\"name\":\"A-linter\",\"color\":\"4F58F6\",\"default\":false,\"description\":\"Area - Linter (oxlint): rules, config, diagnostics, fixes. Add L-* labels for details\",\"archived_at\":null,\"archived_by\":null},{\"id\":13054122419,\"node_id\":\"LA_kwDOI7qa7s8AAAADChYZsw\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/oxc/labels/triage:%20fix%20verified\",\"name\":\"triage: fix verified\",\"color\":\"0e8a16\",\"default\":false,\"description\":\"The proposed fix was verified\",\"archived_at\":null,\"archived_by\":null},{\"id\":13054122792,\"node_id\":\"LA_kwDOI7qa7s8AAAADChYbKA\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/oxc/labels/-%20P2\",\"name\":\"- P2\",\"color\":\"fbca04\",\"default\":false,\"description\":\"Confirmed issue with normal priority\",\"archived_at\":null,\"archived_by\":null},{\"id\":13124474875,\"node_id\":\"LA_kwDOI7qa7s8AAAADDkeX-w\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/oxc/labels/A-napi\",\"name\":\"A-napi\",\"color\":\"1d76db\",\"default\":false,\"description\":\"Area - Node.js bindings and WASM builds of the napi/ packages, oxc_napi\",\"archived_at\":null,\"archived_by\":null}],\"state\":\"open\",\"locked\":false,\"assignees\":[],\"milestone\":null,\"comments\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:06:49Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-11-24T11:46:46Z\",\"closed_at\":null,\"assignee\":null,\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"issue_field_values\":[],\"type\":{\"id\":20828308,\"node_id\":\"IT_kwDOCO__fs4BPdCU\",\"name\":\"Bug\",\"description\":\"An unexpected problem or behavior\",\"color\":\"red\",\"created_at\":\"2024-02-20T08:24:00Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2024-07-26T15:32:05Z\",\"is_enabled\":true},\"status\":{\"id\":8,\"name\":\"In review\",\"category\":\"started\"},\"active_lock_reason\":null,\"sub_issues_summary\":{\"total\":0,\"completed\":0,\"percent_completed\":0},\"issue_dependencies_summary\":{\"blocked_by\":0,\"total_blocked_by\":0,\"blocking\":0,\"total_blocking\":0},\"body\":\"### What happened?\\n\\n`oxlint@1.95.0` (`@oxlint/binding-linux-x64-gnu@1.95.0`) crashes immediately with `SIGILL` (Illegal instruction) even on `oxlint --version` on Linux x86-64 CPUs without BMI2/AVX2.\\n\\n`oxlint@1.94.0` (`@oxlint/binding-linux-x64-gnu@1.94.0`) works cleanly on the exact same machine.\\n\\n### Reproduction\\n\\n```sh\\npnpm dlx oxlint@1.95.0 --version\\n# Illegal instruction (core dumped)\\n```\\n\\n### GDB disassembly at crash\\n\\n```text\\nThread 1 \\\"node-MainThread\\\" received signal SIGILL, Illegal instruction.\\n0x00007fffa727c33c in ?? () from .../node_modules/@oxlint/binding-linux-x64-gnu/oxlint.linux-x64-gnu.node\\n=> 0x7fffa727c33c:\\trorx   $0x10,%ecx,%ecx\\n   0x7fffa727c342:\\tadd    %ecx,%r9d\\n   0x7fffa727c345:\\trorx   $0x10,%edx,%edx\\n   0x7fffa727c34b:\\tadd    %edx,%esi\\n   0x7fffa727c34d:\\txor    %r9d,%ebx\\n```\\n\\n`rorx` is a BMI2 (`x86-64-v3`) instruction. It looks like `oxlint.linux-x64-gnu.node` (or a dependency compiled into it — the `rorx $0x10` + `add` + `xor` pattern looks like a ChaCha/Blake/hash round) was compiled with BMI2 enabled unconditionally instead of targeting baseline `x86-64` or gating behind runtime CPU feature detection.\\n\\n### Environment\\n\\n- **Oxlint:** `1.95.0` (broken) vs `1.94.0` (works)\\n- **Package:** `@oxlint/binding-linux-x64-gnu@1.95.0`\\n- **OS:** Arch Linux x86_64\\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i7-3770 (Ivy Bridge; flags include `sse sse2 sse4_1 sse4_2 avx popcnt`, no `bmi2`/`avx2`)\\n- **Node.js:** v22.23.3\",\"closed_by\":null,\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/oxc/issues/30164/reactions\",\"total_count\":1,\"+1\":1,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0},\"timeline_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/oxc-project/oxc/issues/30164/timeline\",\"performed_via_github_app\":null,\"state_reason\":null,\"pinned_comment\":null}",
